  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pact for the Future Action days 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building on the proposals in the Our Common Agenda report, the Summit of the Future offers a unique opportunity to restore trust, galvanize political will, and take decisive actions, demonstrating the UN&#x2019;s and the international community&apos;s capability to address both current and future challenges. 

Scheduled for 20-21 September, the Summit Action Days will drive further commitments from Member States, civil society, foundations, and other stakeholders. These Action Days will amplify young and diverse voices in global decision-making, fostering innovative cooperation and ensuring sustainable development for future generations. They will also reinforce the outcomes of the 69th Civil Society Conference in May 2024, where 20 ImPact coalitions were formed.</narrative>
  </description>
